   "id": "ko_l3_reading",
   "type": "reading",
   "title": "Reading: a trip to Gyeongju",
   "lessons": [
    {
     "id": "ko_l3_reading_1",
     "title": "Reading: a trip to Gyeongju",
     "summary": "A travel blog with connectors and descriptions.",
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "passage",
       "title": "경주 여행",
       "target": "지난달에 친구하고 경주에 갔어요. 서울에서 기차를 타고 두 시간쯤 걸렸어요. 경주는 오래된 도시라서 유명한 관광지가 많아요. 불국사는 경치가 아름답고 조용했지만 사람이 조금 많았어요. 날씨가 더워서 오후에는 숙소에서 쉬었어요. 다음에는 가을에 가고 싶어요.",
       "en": "Last month I went to Gyeongju with a friend. We took the train from Seoul and it took about two hours. Gyeongju is an old city, so there are many famous sights. Bulguksa had beautiful scenery and was peaceful, but there were quite a few people. Because the weather was hot, we rested at our accommodation in the afternoon. Next time I want to go in autumn."
      },
      {
       "type": "vocab",
       "items": [
        {
         "target": "오래되다",
         "en": "to be old (not new)",
         "pron": "o-rae-doe-da"
        },
        {
         "target": "걸리다",
         "en": "to take (time)",
         "pron": "geol-li-da"
        },
        {
         "target": "-고 싶다",
         "en": "want to",
         "pron": "go sip-da"
        }
       ]
      }
     ],
     "questions": [
      {
